---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ImageGallery from "../components/ImageGallery.astro";
import HorizontalCard from "../components/HorizontalCard.astro";
import BlogPostCard from "../components/BlogPostCard.astro";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import createSlug from "../lib/createSlug";

const posts = (await getCollection("blog"))
  .filter((post) => post.data.tags?.includes("Sabotador"))
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.pubDate.valueOf() - a.data.pubDate.valueOf());
---

<BaseLayout title = "Sabotador.com" sideBarActiveItemID="sabotador">

  <div class="prose prose-lg prose-invert max-w-none">

  <img src="/sabotador/header.svg" alt="Sabotador Header" ... />

  <div class="mt-5">
    <ImageGallery folder="sabotador/intro" alt="Sabotador gameplay" />
  </div>

  <div>
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5 mt-10">What is Sabotador.com?</div>
  </div>

  <div class="pb-4 mt-5">
    <div class="py-2">
      <p class="text-lg text-justify">
        Sabotador.com is a community-driven non-profit Minecraft server built around the classic <a href="https://mcpvpminecraftpvp.fandom.com/wiki/Sabotage" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sabotage</a> minigame.
        Built by and for members of the now-closed GameMods server, it strives to keep the minigame's core while
        also shaking things up with great adjustments to mechanics, overall balance and game modifiers!
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-justify mt-3">
        Whether you're a veteran who remembers the original or a newcomer looking for a quick match, Sabotador.com offers regular updates, seasonal events and game modifiers to keep every round feeling different.
      </p>
    </div>

    <img src="/sabotador/explosions.gif" alt="Explosions" ... />

    <div class="aspect-video w-full mt-4">
      <iframe
        class="w-full h-full rounded-lg"
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/AaC3p_cCHoU"
        title="Sabotador trailer"
        loading="lazy"
        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
        allowfullscreen
      ></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>

    <div>
      <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5 mt-10">Overall balance changes</div>
    </div>

    <div class="pb-4 mt-5">
      <div class="py-2">
        <p class="text-lg text-justify">
          During its first months of operation, a couple of experimental changes were tested and (mostly) implemented into the real game.
          I learned much while designing and adjusting these as feedback and data was collected from them. Check out the blogposts for
          a deep dive into the thought process behind them!
        </p>
        <div class="not-prose mt-3">
          <BlogPostCard slug="sabotage/corpse_reports" />
          <BlogPostCard slug="sabotage/gratitude" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5 mt-10">The modern test</div>
    </div>

    <div class="pb-4 mt-5">
      <div class="py-2">
        <p class="text-lg text-justify">
          On April 2025, the largest test on the server's history was realized: A full port to the then-latest version,
          1.21.5. It was one last hurrah for the server before it went on a hiatus. I've written a blogpost detailing
          the process of porting, the successes and the failures of the test.
        </p>
        <div class="not-prose mt-3">
          <BlogPostCard slug="sabotage/modern_test" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  <div>
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5 mt-10">Game Modifiers</div>
  </div>

  <div class="pb-4 mt-5">
    <div class="py-2">
      <p class="text-lg text-justify">
        On January 2026, the server regained traction and I cooked up a very long forgotten idea: Game Modifiers!
        They freshen up matches by introducing gameplay changes not present in regular playing.
        Each modifier tweaks the rules of a match in a different way, so no two rounds play out quite the same.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <div class="text-2xl w-full font-bold mb-5 mt-10">Seasonal events</div>
  </div>

  <div class="pb-4 mt-5">
    <div class="py-2">
      <p class="text-lg text-justify">
        Throughout the year, limited-time events bring themed changes to the server for holidays and special occasions.
        Seasonal events are also available off-season as game modifiers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <div class="text-2xl w-full font-bold mb-5 mt-10">Voted Modifiers</div>
  </div>

  <div class="pb-4 mt-5">
    <div class="py-2">
      <p class="text-lg text-justify">
        After returning to the lobby, there's a 20% chance a vote to activate a random modifier will begin.
        Players decide together whether the modifier is applied to the next match.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5 mt-10">Latest from blog</div>
  </div>

  {
    posts.map((post) => (
      <>
        <HorizontalCard
          title={post.data.title}
          img={post.data.heroImage}
          desc={post.data.description}
          url={"/blog/" + createSlug(post.data.title, post.slug)}
          target="_self"
          tags={post.data.tags}
        />
        <div class="divider my-0" />
      </>
    ))
  }

  </div>

</BaseLayout>
